    "title": "What I do these days",
    "body": [
      "Draft: I'm a Senior UI/UX Designer and Assistant Creative Director at Praxxys Solutions, where I've been since 2022. Most days I'm somewhere between a client call, a Figma file and a developer's desk, making sure what we promised is what gets built.",
      "Draft: I lead projects from the first requirements meeting to handover and QA, keep our design system in shape, and help the juniors on the team find their footing."
